id: example/dave-good-dad-objective-holon
title: "Dave / good dad objective holon"
kind: example
status: informative
spec_version: objective-holon.v0.1
updated: 2026-08-28
executable_fixture_ref: fixtures/dave-good-dad-objective-holon.v0.1.json

source_signal:
  asserted_by: principal:dave
  text: "I want to be a good dad."
  epistemic_status: reported

compile_projection:
  detections:
    - kind: principal
      value: Dave
      epistemic_status: reported
    - kind: desire
      value: "Be a good dad"
      epistemic_status: reported
    - kind: objective_candidate
      value: "Dave / good dad"
      epistemic_status: inferred
      confidence: 0.93
    - kind: arena
      value: "Dave's family relationships and parenting situations"
      epistemic_status: inferred
      confidence: 0.78
    - kind: lacuna
      value: "Which observable patterns would count as movement for this ongoing objective?"
      epistemic_status: inferred
      confidence: 0.72
  correction_operators: [confirm, reject, correct, add_more]

proposed_structure:
  objective_candidate_ref: objective-candidate:dave:good-dad
  parent_yawn_ref: yawn:dave:root
  yawn_ref: yawn:dave:good-dad
  bot_ref: bot:dave:good-dad
  bot_state: sleeping
  independence_reasons:
    - distinct_objective
    - ongoing_time_horizon
    - distinct_relationships
    - recurring_proof_loop

ratification_receipt:
  ratification_receipt_ref: ratification:dave:good-dad
  objective_candidate_ref: objective-candidate:dave:good-dad
  decision: accepted
  objective_ref: objective:dave:good-dad
  yawn_ref: null
  bot_ref: null
  principal_ref: principal:dave
  authorized_by: principal:dave
  boundary: >
    This receipt ratifies the objective without structural refs. The later
    StructuralChangeReceipt and BotBindingReceipt create the Yawn and bind the
    sleeping bot; ratification does not create, bind, activate, grant authority,
    or authorize external effects.

ratified_objective:
  objective_ref: objective:dave:good-dad
  principal_ref: principal:dave
  statement: "Be a good dad."
  purpose: "Steward how Dave shows up in his relationships with Sophia and Jace."
  mode: maintain
  horizon: ongoing
  guardrails:
    - "Do not reduce another family member to Dave's model of them."
    - "Do not treat intensity, intention, or self-description as proof."
    - "Do not optimize a score in place of the relationships themselves."

yawn_materialization:
  operation: create_yawn
  structural_change_receipt_ref: structural-change:dave:good-dad:create-yawn
  receipt_schema_ref: schemas/agency-holarchy.v0.2.schema.json#/$defs/StructuralChangeReceipt
  exact_proposed_routing_proposal_ref: routing-proposal:dave:good-dad:create-yawn
  rightful_authority_ref: authority:dave:root
  current_head_check: unresolved-in-this-informative-example
  aggregate_resolution_status: unavailable-in-objective-holon-v0.1
  boundary: >
    This example names the separate Agency Holarchy receipt required to create
    the Yawn. The Objective Holon fixture does not embed or resolve the Routing
    Proposal, authority record, current holarchy head, or structural receipt, so
    it does not claim end-to-end objective materialization conformance.

objective_yawn:
  projection_status: informative-unresolved-until-aggregate-resolution
  yawn_ref: yawn:dave:good-dad
  primary_parent_yawn_ref: yawn:dave:root
  primary_objective_ref: objective:dave:good-dad
  current_lacuna: "What needs attention now in order to serve this objective?"
  child_examples:
    - yawn:dave:good-dad/repair-after-rupture
    - yawn:dave:good-dad/weekly-one-on-one-time
  lateral_links:
    - relation: dave-good-dad coordinates_with dave-partner
    - relation: dave-good-dad depends_on family-shared-commitments

bot_binding_receipt:
  bot_binding_receipt_ref: bot-binding:dave:good-dad
  bot_ref: bot:dave:good-dad
  yawn_ref: yawn:dave:good-dad
  objective_ref: objective:dave:good-dad
  ratification_receipt_ref: ratification:dave:good-dad
  from_binding_state: proposed
  to_binding_state: sleeping
  structural_change_receipt_ref: structural-change:dave:good-dad:create-yawn
  principal_ref: principal:dave
  authority_ref: authority:dave:root
  authorization_status: authorized
  authorized_by: principal:dave
  effects:
    bot_activated: false
    authority_granted: false
    effect_authority_granted: false
    external_effects_authorized: false
  boundary: >
    This receipt binds the bot to an already materialized Yawn in sleeping state.
    It does not ratify the objective, create the Yawn, activate the bot, grant
    authority, or authorize external effects. Application still requires external
    resolution of the structural receipt, rightful authority, and current head.

activation_receipt:
  activation_receipt_ref: activation:dave:good-dad
  bot_ref: bot:dave:good-dad
  yawn_ref: yawn:dave:good-dad
  objective_ref: objective:dave:good-dad
  from_state: sleeping
  to_state: active
  principal_ref: principal:dave
  authority_grant_refs:
    - authority:dave:good-dad:orient
  authorized_by: principal:dave
  boundary: >
    This receipt activates bounded orientation stewardship. Activation does not
    itself authorize an external effect. Application must authenticate the
    principal, resolve the exact grants and current lifecycle state, and enforce
    append-only receipt-ID idempotency.

yawn_bot:
  bot_ref: bot:dave:good-dad
  role: objective_steward
  lifecycle_state: active
  parent_bot_ref: bot:dave:root
  principal_ref: principal:dave
  personality_profile_ref: null
  ratification_receipt_refs:
    - ratification:dave:good-dad
  binding_receipt_refs:
    - bot-binding:dave:good-dad
  activation_receipt_refs:
    - activation:dave:good-dad
  authority_grant_refs:
    - authority:dave:good-dad:orient
  receives_structural_context:
    - value:dave:family
    - relationship:dave:sophia
    - relationship:dave:jace
  does_not_inherit:
    - other_people's private models
    - consent
    - truth
    - confidence
    - effect authority
    - proof

proof_boundary: >
  The bot can record evidence about bounded behaviors and relationship outcomes.
  It cannot prove that Dave is, globally or permanently, a good dad. Each result
  updates the orientation and exposes the next lacuna.
